- Full: `make test`, `make lint`, `make shell-test`, `make docs-check`, `make docs-reality`.
- Built-binary proof: run a temporary inline stage fixture that writes output, a valid sidecar and both streams; inspect `etude run show` and the manifest for session ID, imported transcript digest, log digest/content and output digest. Repeat with no sidecar/no streams to prove backward compatibility.

